Package: libsmmasset0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Breaks: libsmm-asset (<< 1.0.0)
Replaces: libsmm-asset (<< 1.0.0)
Description: Asset Library for Search Management Map - runtime
 C library for acting as an asset (search aircraft, boat, or ground
 party) against a Search Management Map server: reporting positions,
 receiving commands, and accepting and completing searches.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libsmm-asset-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libsmmasset0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends},
 libtidy-dev, libjansson-dev, libcurl4-openssl-dev | libcurl4-gnutls-dev
Breaks: libsmm-asset (<< 1.0.0)
Replaces: libsmm-asset (<< 1.0.0)
Description: Asset Library for Search Management Map - development files
 C library for acting as an asset (search aircraft, boat, or ground
 party) against a Search Management Map server: reporting positions,
 receiving commands, and accepting and completing searches.
 .
 This package contains the header, the development symlink, and the
 pkg-config file. The libcurl/jansson/tidy development packages are
 dependencies because smm-asset.pc references them via Requires.private,
 which pkg-config resolves even for dynamic linking.
